nsters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309830/extras/8f91281bad574d0e120c3f49e2388c75.poster.avif?t=1754656087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309830/extras/8f91281bad574d0e120c3f49e2388c75.webm?t=1754656087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309830/extras/8f91281bad574d0e120c3f49e2388c75.mp4?t=1754656087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Destroy Alien Monsters using various Laser Tanks equipped with powerful Lasers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309830/extras/b1cd251e070ca9bad48d6ca70bd2459f.poster.avif?t=1754656087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309830/extras/b1cd251e070ca9bad48d6ca70bd2459f.webm?t=1754656087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309830/extras/b1cd251e070ca9bad48d6ca70bd2459f.mp4?t=1754656087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Experience a stunning world of environments like Dark Forests, Dungeons, Sci-Fi, etc.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309830/extras/21c6836fdee1789909249a11367b020f.poster.avif?t=1754656087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309830/extras/21c6836fdee1789909249a11367b020f.webm?t=1754656087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309830/extras/21c6836fdee1789909249a11367b020f.mp4?t=1754656087\" type=\"vi